      "text": "Annex 2. Conflict of interest",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bk",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        149.25872802734375,
        434.13970947265625,
        187.49871826171875
      ],
      "text": "assessment for Guideline",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bk",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        187.65869140625,
        434.488525390625,
        225.898681640625
      ],
      "text": "Development Group and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bk",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        226.0587158203125,
        405.8900146484375,
        264.2987060546875
      ],
      "text": "External Review Group",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bk",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        264.458740234375,
        205.835693359375,
        302.69873046875
      ],
      "text": "members",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bk",
      "size": 32.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.6986999511719,
        526.9476318359375,
        352.8437194824219
      ],
      "text": "Before being considered for group membership, each Guideline Development Group (GDG) and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        355.1986999511719,
        526.9920043945312,
        368.3437194824219
      ],
      "text": "External Review Group candidate was required to submit a completed declaration of interest",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        370.6986999511719,
        526.9258422851562,
        383.8437194824219
      ],
      "text": "(DOI) form. In addition, a preliminary internet search was performed to identify any obvious",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        386.1986999511719,
        527.1436767578125,
        399.3437194824219
      ],
      "text": "public controversies or interests that may lead to compromising situations for the World Health",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.967101097106934,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.6986999511719,
        303.76605224609375,
        414.8437194824219
      ],
      "text": "Organization (WHO) and the expert concerned.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.70269775390625,
        526.9655151367188,
        438.84771728515625
      ],
      "text": "The candidate’s curriculum vitae (CV) and DOI, and information retrieved from the internet,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        441.20269775390625,
        527.1461181640625,
        454.34771728515625
      ],
      "text": "were examined by steering committee members to assess whether there were, or may be,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        456.70269775390625,
        526.9083251953125,
        469.84771728515625
      ],
      "text": "actual or perceived conflicts of interest and, if so, whether a management plan was required.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        472.20269775390625,
        526.96533203125,
        485.34771728515625
      ],
      "text": "This evaluation process, and resultant management plans, were based on the  Guidelines for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        487.70269775390625,
        526.9506225585938,
        500.84771728515625
      ],
      "text": "and the  declaration of interests (WHO experts) (1) WHO handbook for guideline development",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        503.20269775390625,
        151.73660278320312,
        516.3477172851562
      ],
      "text": ". (2nd edition) (2)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        525.7066040039062,
        526.9656372070312,
        538.8516235351562
      ],
      "text": "Both financial and non-financial interests were considered. A “significant” conflict of interest",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.7066040039062,
        143.56471252441406,
        552.8516235351562
      ],
      "text": "would include:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.4586181640625,
        78.81909942626953,
        572.6036376953125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        559.4586181640625,
        526.9422607421875,
        572.6036376953125
      ],
      "text": "“intellectual bias”, where an individual may have repeatedly and publicly taken a position",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        574.95849609375,
        526.9642333984375,
        588.103515625
      ],
      "text": "on an issue under review, which may affect the individual’s objectivity and independence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        590.45849609375,
        288.3270263671875,
        603.603515625
      ],
      "text": "in the global policy development process;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.95849609375,
        78.81909942626953,
        619.103515625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        605.95849609375,
        506.6087341308594,
        619.103515625
      ],
      "text": "involvement in research or publication of materials related to issues under review; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.45849609375,
        78.81909942626953,
        634.603515625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        621.45849609375,
        260.14837646484375,
        634.603515625
      ],
      "text": "a financial interest above US$ 5000.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        648.2972412109375,
        526.7501220703125,
        661.4422607421875
      ],
      "text": "Developers of any assay are never involved in the process of policy development; this is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        663.7972412109375,
        296.637451171875,
        676.9422607421875
      ],
      "text": "automatically considered a conflict of interest.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        687.8011474609375,
        527.259521484375,
        700.9461669921875
      ],
      "text": "Once a determination was made that either no conflict of interest existed, or any conflict",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.3011474609375,
        526.9918823242188,
        716.4461669921875
      ],
      "text": "of interest could be appropriately managed, and a decision had been made to appoint the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        718.8010864257812,
        527.0029296875,
        731.9461059570312
      ],
      "text": "candidate, the name and a brief biography of each candidate were published on the WHO",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        734.3010864257812,
        460.9529113769531,
        747.4461059570312
      ],
      "text": "website for at least 14 days before the meeting, for public notice and comment.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        543.0333862304688,
        802.0169067382812,
        556.809326171875,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "153",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
